# RESTLESS: the demo player's cherry plan, with real button presses from the
# title: early in the first half it walks into foes on purpose until it has
# three deaths, so treasure is richer (any more and the soul rounds turn
# deadly), then plays the game through, rings the bells it finds to take
# deaths back, and lays the King to rest with more than 50,000 points.
seed 7
game restless
wait 10
cheat botplan 1
botuntil revivals >= 3 30000
expect half == 0
expect goals & 1
botuntil half >= 1 30000
botuntil half >= 3 60000
botuntil half >= 5 80000
botuntil state == 9 40000
expect won == 1
expect save_best_won >= 50000
expect goals == 7
